 "methods": [
  "Use only own comune 1 January 2026 ISTAT estimate, age 999 total; verify equality with ages 0 through 100 and sex totals for all 7896 comuni. Time-slice own P31/P131/P635 claims to 1 January 2026 using start/end qualifiers, retaining their dated statements. Bind literal own Wikidata P31 comune of Italy and P635, existing type/local type/level/parent, P131 matching existing state, same official province and original point inside the valid own 2026 comune polygon. SITUAS January 2026 AP/RN events with unchanged name and cadastral code bridge old population codes and new boundary codes, preserving the comune; never follow extinction or successor edges. Hold conflicts, unavailable identity evidence and unproved v4 continuity. Only population and population_year change. Existing locality and section rows are unchanged. Review all missing-year rows; mark outside-scope rows separately."
 ],
